%% Activity: Autentikasi user dashboard (V3-FR01)
%% Actor: Admin/Viewer → Flask backend → SQLite
flowchart TD
    A([User membuka /login]) --> B[Isi username + password]
    B --> C{POST /api/auth/login}
    C --> D{Rate limit 30/mnt}
    D -- lebih --> E[429 rate_limited]
    D -- ok --> F{User ada & bcrypt cocok?}
    F -- tidak --> G[401 unauthorized]
    F -- ya --> H[Buat session + CSRF token]
    H --> I([Dashboard terbuka])
    I --> J{Mutasi data}
    J --> K[Header X-CSRF-Token == session?]
    K -- tidak --> L[403 csrf_mismatch]
    K -- ya --> M([Aksi dijalankan])
